      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Tricky assignment to assess with a few of these facing the starter for the first time. Of the raced brigade, RAGING RAIDER (8) returned in good order with a close-up third at the Sunny Coast before maybe suffering from the dreaded second-up syndrome at Eagle Farm at the latest effort. Will be ready to peak now third run back and looks the one they all have to run down. GRIEVE ROAD (3) has been well in the betting in both career outings to date and where there's smoke there's fire. Watch for sharp improvement. DRAGON MAGIC (2) is drawn to get all the favours from the inside alley and rates a genuine top-three contender against this line-up. TED LASSO (6) just missed the frame on debut and will have derived a stack of benefit from that race day experience. In the mix. WEONA SATONO (9) is a first starter but hails from an astute stable and should be kept very safe.",
